  "metadata": {
    "source": "concept_agent",
    "requirements": "This system represents different types of vehicles. \nA Vehicle has a position, a speed and a maximum speed. Besides, it has an environment (with a value among “land”, “water” and “air”). Finally, it can move for a given time. Those are the features of a generic vehicle.\nThen, we have land vehicles and marine vehicles as specific types of vehicles, where both have all the same features as a vehicle. Finally, an amphibious vehicle can be both a land vehicle and a marine vehicle. ",
